{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_061FE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"喂，Snake，你不会往口粮里放点甜食吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"从没想过。为什么？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"我最喜欢甜食了！法国的点心可是特别好吃。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"可丽饼啊，<R=泡芙,CHOU A LA CREME >、<R=闪电泡芙,ECLAIR>、玛德琳，还有<R=费南雪,FINANCIER>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=泡芙,CHOU A LA CREME >\", \"<R=闪电泡芙,ECLAIR>\", \"<R=费南雪,FINANCIER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"还有塔坦苹果挞。萨瓦兰也不能少。<R=千层酥,MILLE-FEUILLE>、可丽饼、牛奶冻……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=千层酥,MILLE-FEUILLE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"可丽饼，这是第二次了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"舒芙蕾、泡芙塔、可露丽、佛罗伦汀、库因阿曼、蜜桃梅尔巴……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"说完了吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"……还有马卡龙！我最喜欢马卡龙了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"而且果然还是<R=巴黎马卡龙,MACARON PARISIEN>最好。五颜六色的，样子也很可爱，而且用了蛋白霜，入口即化。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=巴黎马卡龙,MACARON PARISIEN>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"真意外。没想到马卡龙在法国也这么受欢迎。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"“在法国也”……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"对啊。<R=马卡龙,MACAROON>……不就是椰子味的曲奇吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=马卡龙,MACAROON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"才不是！马卡龙里放的是<R=杏仁粉,POUDRE D'AMANDE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=杏仁粉,POUDRE D'AMANDE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不是花生吗？我在日本也吃过几次。名字好像还叫“Makoron”来着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"Makoron？那……那肯定是在模仿法国的。听好了，法国的马卡龙可是有悠久历史的点心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":115,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"要追溯到16世纪。佛罗伦萨美第奇家族有个叫Catherine的姑娘嫁进了法国王室。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"据说，就是她带来的<R=糕点师,PATISSIER>把做法传了过来，这才成了马卡龙的起源。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=糕点师,PATISSIER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"怎么样？有将近500年的历史哦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"来自佛罗伦萨的美第奇家族？那这么说，本来不就是意大利点心吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"这边的<R=马卡龙,MACAROON>，八成也是从意大利传来的吧？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=马卡龙,MACAROON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"这……这怎么可能……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"说起来，<R=马卡龙,MACARON>这个名字和<R=马卡罗尼,MACARONI>也挺像的。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=马卡龙,MACARON>\", \"<R=马卡罗尼,MACARONI>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"肯定没错。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"……真不敢相信。居然把马卡龙和马卡罗尼混为一谈……Miller先生，你真是不解风情！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"为、为什么只怪我……喂——等等，Cécile！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""}]}